{"file": "末日觉醒，我的神级选择-第1集.mp4", "ep": 1, "duration": 89.9, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.52, "text": "世朝降临 世界淪陷"}, {"start": 8.07, "end": 9.11, "text": "把自己绑起来"}, {"start": 10.35, "end": 11.23, "text": "你想干吗"}, {"start": 12.53, "end": 13.57, "text": "你说我想干吗"}, {"start": 13.57, "end": 14.53, "text": "你有病吧"}, {"start": 15.22, "end": 17.02, "text": "都这个时候了还想着这些"}, {"start": 17.34, "end": 18.18, "text": "我数三下"}, {"start": 18.7, "end": 19.86, "text": "你要是敢碰我"}, {"start": 19.98, "end": 20.5, "text": "我死也不"}, {"start": 20.5, "end": 21.02, "text": "三"}, {"start": 23.25, "end": 24.53, "text": "你会后悔的"}, {"start": 24.77, "end": 25.41, "text": "手也要"}, {"start": 25.69, "end": 26.33, "text": "伸出来"}, {"start": 26.53, "end": 32.81, "text": "你还是不是男人"}, {"start": 32.81, "end": 34.41, "text": "我就是擦伤了而已"}, {"start": 34.41, "end": 34.97, "text": "闭嘴"}, {"start": 35.65, "end": 37.21, "text": "擦伤什么样我还不清楚"}, {"start": 37.76, "end": 38.76, "text": "天台就这么大"}, {"start": 38.76, "end": 39.64, "text": "你跑不掉"}, {"start": 40.31, "end": 41.03, "text": "不便宜"}, {"start": 42.09, "end": 43.01, "text": "等我找着吃的"}, {"start": 43.21, "end": 43.89, "text": "分你一口"}, {"start": 44.52, "end": 45.12, "text": "便宜了"}, {"start": 45.44, "end": 47.12, "text": "就别怪我现在打爆你的头"}, {"start": 47.52, "end": 49.44, "text": "你就是想独吞东西"}, {"start": 50.77, "end": 52.09, "text": "要不是还有这卷胶带"}, {"start": 52.61, "end": 53.97, "text": "你这会儿已经在楼下了"}, {"start": 59.17, "end": 60.85, "text": "我叫潘雅大三的"}, {"start": 60.97, "end": 61.85, "text": "苏昊大一"}, {"start": 62.54, "end": 63.22, "text": "学弟"}, {"start": 64.1, "end": 64.62, "text": "学姐"}, {"start": 64.94, "end": 72.58, "text": "学弟"}, {"start": 72.9, "end": 73.86, "text": "对不起"}, {"start": 75.35, "end": 75.79, "text": "没事"}, {"start": 76.59, "end": 77.27, "text": "安心去吧"}, {"start": 82.66, "end": 83.3, "text": "安心吧"}, {"start": 83.58, "end": 84.14, "text": "学姐"}]}